OL,3,GNEWSAThousands taking part in Great
OL,4,AScottish Run through Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FTens of thousands of people have
OL,7,Fgathered in Glasgow ahead of this
OL,8,Fyear's Great Scottish Run.
OL,10,FOrganisers predict about 35,000 adults
OL,11,Fand children will take part in a
OL,12,Fweekend of events which kicked off on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FSunday's runs include a 10k and a half
OL,16,Fmarathon, with Scotland's 2022
OL,17,FCommonwealth Games gold medallist
OL,18,FEilish McColgan and charity fundraiser
OL,19,FCraig Ferguson the official starters.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
