OL,3,GNEWSAThousands taking part in Great
OL,4,AScottish Run through Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaturday's schedule saw the return of
OL,7,Fevents for junior runners and toddlers,
OL,8,Fafter fears over Storm Amy last year
OL,9,Fforced them to be cancelled.
